{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はAGESTOCK2013 in早稲田祭におじゃまさせて頂きましたヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大学生の皆さん乃木坂ファミリーの皆さんとイベントを一緒にさせて頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった皆さんありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/02/8481447/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂初めてだよ〜って方は乃木坂に興味を持って頂いたら嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからよろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/02/8481447/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃん秋田の高校を文化祭をやる前に転校したので文化祭をあまり知らないんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大学と高校は違うと思うのですが、友達と学校全体でひとつのイベントを作り上げるっていいな〜って！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46としていろんなものを作らせて頂いているけど今日大学生のお兄さんお姉さん達見てたら凄くかっこよかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"回りたかったな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タピオカ美味しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"届けて下さってありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/02/8481447/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/02/8481447/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ〜タピオカ美味しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/02/8481447/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/02/8481447/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃん遅くなってごめんね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/02/8481447/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/02/8481447/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/02/8481447/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/02/8481447/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/02/8481447/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/02/8481447/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/02/8481447/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/02/8481447/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/02/8481447/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/02/8481447/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/02/8481447/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/02/8481447/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/20